WEBVTT

00:04:30.066 --> 00:04:32.035
“Fintech,” he said.

00:04:32.803 --> 00:04:35.172
Curious. I dug a little deeper.

00:04:35.205 --> 00:04:36.807
"Oh, what type?"

00:04:36.840 --> 00:04:38.809
"It's complicated."

00:04:38.842 --> 00:04:40.510
(Laughter)

00:04:41.945 --> 00:04:43.446
End of discussion.

00:04:43.446 --> 00:04:47.584
OK. Now it's possible that he wanted
to spare me some long explanation,

00:04:47.617 --> 00:04:51.655
but it's more likely that his bias,
implicit or not,

00:04:51.655 --> 00:04:55.792
informed him that as a woman
I wouldn't understand finance.

00:04:55.826 --> 00:05:00.230
Either way, I'm fairly certain
he wouldn't have said "it's complicated"